  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Monodromy and untwisted quantum minors\n\n`qmin[I,J]` is stored as an expanded 24×24 matrix polynomial in the formal symbol `u` (symbolic `θ1, θ2, h`); `qminAt[I,J][x]` evaluates it. The formula explicitly antisymmetrises the **rows** with descending shifts. Antisymmetry in the **columns** is then a real RTT consequence, so it checks that the shift direction matches this Lax convention.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 2. Monodromy T = L1(u-θ1) L2(u-θ2), L_ij(u) = u δ_ij - h E_ji; all quantum minors qmin_{I,J}. ---- *)\nClearAll[Tm, qmin, qminAt, subsetsA, ν, hwIndex, u, x, θ1, θ2, h];\nTm[i_, j_][y_] := Sum[\n    ((y - θ1) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[dtot, SparseArray] - h E1g[k, i]).((y - θ2) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[dtot, SparseArray] - h E2g[j, k]),\n    {k, 3}];\nsubsetsA[a_] := Subsets[Range[3], {a}];\nqmin[II_List, JJl_List] := qmin[II, JJl] = Expand @ Normal @ Sum[\n    Signature[σ] (Dot @@ Table[Tm[II[[σ[[k]]]], JJl[[k]]][u - (k - 1) h], {k, Length[II]}]),\n    {σ, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\nqminAt[II_List, JJl_List][y_] := qmin[II, JJl] /. u -> y;\n(* Yangian weights on the pseudovacuum |λ1>⊗|λ2> *)\nν[i_][y_] := (y - θ1 - h λ1[[i]]) (y - θ2 - h λ2[[i]]);\nhwIndex = First @ Flatten @ Position[Transpose[Table[Diagonal[Normal[Etot[i, i]]], {i, 3}]], λ1 + λ2];\nWith[{zero = ConstantArray[0, {dtot, dtot}], e = UnitVector[dtot, hwIndex]},\n Grid[{\n   {\"pseudovacuum index\", hwIndex},\n   {\"T_ii |Ω> = ν_i |Ω>\", And @@ Table[Expand[Tm[i, i][u].e - ν[i][u] e] === ConstantArray[0, dtot], {i, 3}]},\n   {\"T_ij |Ω> = 0 for i > j\", And @@ Flatten @ Table[Expand[Tm[i, j][u].e] === ConstantArray[0, dtot], {i, 3}, {j, i - 1}]},\n   {\"qmin_{I,J} antisymmetric in J (|I|=2, all I,J)\", And @@ Flatten @ Table[Expand[qmin[II, JJl] + qmin[II, Reverse[JJl]]] === zero, {II, subsetsA[2]}, {JJl, subsetsA[2]}]},\n   {\"qmin_{123,π(123)} = sgn π qdet\", And @@ Table[Expand[qmin[{1, 2, 3}, p] - Signature[p] qmin[{1, 2, 3}, {1, 2, 3}]] === zero, {p, Permutations[{1, 2, 3}]}]},\n   {\"qdet = ν1(u-2h) ν2(u-h) ν3(u) · Id\", Expand[qmin[{1, 2, 3}, {1, 2, 3}] - ν[1][u - 2 h] ν[2][u - h] ν[3][u] IdentityMatrix[dtot]] === zero}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"24223\" data-output-id=\"2\" data-out-n=\"27\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[27]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.24em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pseudovacuum index</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T_ii |Ω&gt; = </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">_i |Ω&gt;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T_ij |Ω&gt; = 0 for i &gt; j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qmin_{I,J} antisymmetric in J (|I|=2, all I,J)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qmin_{123,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\">(123)} = sgn </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"> qdet</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qdet = </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">1(u-2h) </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">2(u-h) </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">3(u) </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> Id</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[27]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{pseudovacuum index} & 1\\\\\\hline\\text{T\\_ii |$\\Omega$> = $\\nu$\\_i |$\\Omega$>} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{T\\_ij |$\\Omega$> = 0 for i > j} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{qmin\\_\\{I,J\\} antisymmetric in J (|I|=2, all I,J)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{qmin\\_\\{123,$\\pi$(123)\\} = sgn $\\pi$ qdet} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{qdet = $\\nu$1(u-2h) $\\nu$2(u-h) $\\nu$3(u) $\\cdot$ Id} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "7348be36-2905-4969-9bf7-ebf9afc1e5b8"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Companion twist, twisted quantum minors, transfer matrices\n\n`G = {{χ1,−χ2,χ3},{1,0,0},{0,1,0}}`, with `det(z−G) = z³ − χ1 z² + χ2 z − χ3`.\n\n- `qminG[I,J] = Σ_{|K|=|I|} qmin[I,K] det G_{K,J}` (Cauchy–Binet for a constant twist), cross-checked against the direct row-antisymmetrised formula applied to `T·G`.\n- `τ[a]` is the transfer-matrix polynomial in `u`, `τAt[a][x]` evaluates it, and `τCo[a,k] = [u^k]τ_a`.\n- The expected structure is `τ_1 = χ1u² + …`, `τ_2 = χ2u⁴ + …`, `τ_3 = χ3 ν1(u−2h)ν2(u−h)ν3(u)`.\n\nThe checks involving commutativity and the spectrum use exact rationals: `θ = (1/3, −8/57)`, `h = 1`, `z = (2, 3, 1/6)`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 3. Companion twist: twisted minors (Cauchy-Binet), transfer matrices; symbolic checks. ---- *)\nClearAll[G, χ1, χ2, χ3, minorG, qminG, qminGdirect, TGm, τ, τAt, τCo, qdetT];\nG = {{χ1, -χ2, χ3}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nminorG[K_List, JJl_List] := Det[G[[K, JJl]]];\nqminG[II_List, JJl_List] := qminG[II, JJl] = Expand @ Sum[qmin[II, K] minorG[K, JJl], {K, subsetsA[Length[II]]}];\n(* direct construction on T.G, used only as a cross-check *)\nTGm[i_, j_][y_] := Sum[Tm[i, k][y] G[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\nqminGdirect[II_List, JJl_List] := Expand @ Normal @ Sum[\n    Signature[σ] (Dot @@ Table[TGm[II[[σ[[k]]]], JJl[[k]]][u - (k - 1) h], {k, Length[II]}]),\n    {σ, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\nτ[a_] := τ[a] = Expand @ Sum[qminG[II, II], {II, subsetsA[a]}];\nτAt[a_][y_] := τ[a] /. u -> y;\nτCo[a_, k_] := τCo[a, k] = Coefficient[τ[a], u, k];\nqdetT[y_] := χ3 ν[1][y - 2 h] ν[2][y - h] ν[3][y];\nModule[{zero = ConstantArray[0, {dtot, dtot}], id = IdentityMatrix[dtot], zz},\n Grid[{\n   {\"charpoly G\", Expand[Det[zz IdentityMatrix[3] - G]]},\n   {\"Cauchy-Binet = direct T·G minors (|I|=1,2,3, all I,J)\", And @@ Flatten @ Table[Expand[qminG[II, JJl] - qminGdirect[II, JJl]] === zero, {a, 3}, {II, subsetsA[a]}, {JJl, subsetsA[a]}]},\n   {\"deg_u τ_1, τ_2, τ_3\", Table[Max[Exponent[Flatten[τ[a]], u]], {a, 3}]},\n   {\"τ_1 leading = χ1 Id\", τCo[1, 2] === χ1 id},\n   {\"τ_2 leading = χ2 Id\", τCo[2, 4] === χ2 id},\n   {\"τ_3 = χ3 ν1(u-2h)ν2(u-h)ν3(u) Id\", Expand[τ[3] - qdetT[u] id] === zero}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"24223\" data-output-id=\"3\" data-out-n=\"38\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[38]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.24em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">charpoly G</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cauchy-Binet = direct T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">G minors (|I|=1,2,3, all I,J)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pst