      },
      {
       "data": "Out[54]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{deg\\_u B} & 6\\\\\\hline\\text{leading coeff (symbolic, $\\propto$ Id?)} & \\left\\{1,\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{[B coeff, B coeff] = 0} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{null-space dims over 24 pattern pairs} & \\left\\{1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{covectors span (rank)} & 24\\\\\\hline\\text{minimal x pattern pair} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{0\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,0,0\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{<0| = e\\_24 is the minimal covector (symbolic check: e\\_24.B = b\\_0(u) e\\_24)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f9622650-5595-4b27-b97a-91fd841780b6"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Vacuum, Baxter Q-functions, normalised SoV covectors\n\n- $|\\Omega\\rangle$ is the joint eigenvector of the companion $\\tau_1$ with eigenvalue $z_1\\nu_1+z_2\\nu_2+z_3\\nu_3$, normalised by $\\langle 0|\\Omega\\rangle = \\Omega_{24} = 1$.\n- Baxter: $\\mathcal O\\,\\hat q_i^{[2]}=0$ with $\\hat q_i(u) = z_i^{u/h} q_i(u)$, $q_i$ a monic polynomial. After dividing out $z_i^{u/h}$ and clearing denominators this reads\n  $z\\,\\nu_1\\nu_1^{[-2]}\\nu_1^{[-4]}q^{[2]} - \\tau_1\\nu_1^{[-2]}\\nu_1^{[-4]}q + z^{-1}\\tau_2\\nu_1^{[-4]}q^{[-2]} - z^{-2}\\tau_3 q^{[-4]} = 0$.\n- $\\Psi(x) = \\prod_\\alpha \\hat q_1(x^\\alpha_{11})\\,\\det_{i,j\\le 2}\\hat q_i(x^\\alpha_{2j})$.\n- Normalisation: $\\langle x|\\Psi\\rangle = \\Psi(x)/\\Psi(x_0)$ applied to $\\Omega$ fixes `xNorm[p]`. Since $x-\\theta_\\alpha\\in h\\mathbb Z$, the factor $z_i^{x/h}$ is evaluated as $z_i^{(x-\\theta_\\alpha)/h}$. The dropped constants $z_1^{\\theta_\\alpha}$ and $z_1^{\\theta_\\alpha}z_2^{\\theta_\\alpha}$ are the same for every $x$ and cancel in the ratio, so everything stays exact rational.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 6. |Ω>, twisted Baxter solver, Ψ(x), normalised covectors <x|. ---- *)\nClearAll[Ω, ΩnullDim, hX, ν1X, τ3X, tauEig, baxSolve, PsiSoV, qOf, qΩ, xNorm, x0];\nhX = h /. prmX;\nν1X[y_] := ν[1][y] /. prmX;\nτ3X[y_] := qdetT[y] /. prmX;\nx0 = Last[patPairs];\nModule[{vac1 = Expand[Sum[zX[[i]] ν[i][u], {i, 3}] /. prmX], ns},\n  ns = NullSpace[Join @@ Table[τCoX[1, k] - Coefficient[vac1, u, k] IdentityMatrix[dtot], {k, 0, 2}]];\n  ΩnullDim = Length[ns];\n  Ω = First[ns]/First[ns][[dtot]]];\n(* τ_a eigenvalue polynomial of an eigenvector v (read off at its largest component) *)\ntauEig[v_, a_] := With[{i = First @ Ordering[Abs[N[v]], -1]}, Sum[(τCoX[a, k] . v)[[i]]/v[[i]] u^k, {k, 0, 2 a}]];\n(* minimal-degree monic q with z^{u/h} q solving the Baxter equation; exact NullSpace or numeric SVD.\n   An identically vanishing system (eq ≡ 0) means every q of that degree works, e.g. q = 1 for the vacuum. *)\nbaxSolve[t1_, t2_, z_] := Module[{c, uu, qq, eq, A, vec = $Failed, d = 0, sv, V},\n  While[vec === $Failed && d <= 8,\n   qq = Sum[c[j] uu^j, {j, 0, d}];\n   eq = Expand[z ν1X[u] ν1X[u - hX] ν1X[u - 2 hX] (qq /. uu -> u + hX) - t1 ν1X[u - hX] ν1X[u - 2 hX] (qq /. uu -> u)\n      + t2 ν1X[u - 2 hX] (qq /. uu -> u - hX)/z - τ3X[u] (qq /. uu -> u - 2 hX)/z^2];\n   A = Table[D[row, c[j]], {row, CoefficientList[eq, u]}, {j, 0, d}];\n   Which[\n    A === {} || Max[Abs[Flatten[A]]] == 0, vec = UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1],\n    Precision[A] === Infinity, With[{ns = NullSpace[A]}, If[ns =!= {}, vec = First[ns]]],\n    True,\n    {sv, V} = {SingularValueList[A, Tolerance -> 0], Last[SingularValueDecomposition[A]]};\n    If[Length[sv] == d + 1 && Last[sv]/First[sv] < 10^-30, vec = V[[All, -1]]]];\n   If[vec === $Failed, d++]];\n  If[vec === $Failed, $Failed, Expand[(vec/Last[vec]) . u^Range[0, d]]]];\nPsiSoV[qs_][p_] := Product[\n   With[{xr = xRoots[α, p[[α]]] /. prmX, θa = {θ1, θ2}[[α]] /. prmX},\n    With[{qh = Function[{i, x}, zX[[i]]^((x - θa)/hX) (qs[[i]] /. u -> x)]},\n     qh[1, xr[[1]]] Det[{{qh[1, xr[[2]]], qh[1, xr[[3]]]}, {qh[2, xr[[2]]], qh[2, xr[[3]]]}}]]],\n   {α, 2}];\nqOf[v_] := Table[baxSolve[tauEig[v, 1], tauEig[v, 2], zX[[i]]], {i, 3}];\nqΩ = qOf[Ω];\nxNorm[p_] := xNorm[p] = With[{vx = First[xCov[p]]}, vx (PsiSoV[qΩ][p]/PsiSoV[qΩ][x0])/(vx . Ω)];\nGrid[{\n  {\"null-space dim for Ω\", ΩnullDim},\n  {\"Ω joint eigenvector of all τ_1, τ_2 coefficients\", And @@ Flatten @ Table[With[{w = τCoX[a, k] . Ω}, MatrixRank[{w, Ω}] <= 1], {a, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}]},\n  {\"q_1, q_2, q_3 for Ω\", qΩ},\n  {\"<x|Ω> ≠ 0 for all x (needed to normalise)\", FreeQ[(First[xCov[#]] . Ω)& /@ patPairs, 0]},\n  {\"Ψ(x_0)\", PsiSoV[qΩ][x0]},\n  {\"normalised <0| = e_24\", xNorm[x0] === UnitVector[dtot, dtot]},\n  {\"<x|Ω> = Ψ(x)/Ψ(x_0) for all x\", And @@ ((xNorm[#] . Ω === PsiSoV[qΩ][#]/PsiSoV[qΩ][x0])& /@ patPairs)}\n }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"24223\" data-output-id=\"6\" data-out-n=\"67\" data-sub-idx=\"15\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"11\" data-sub-start=\"36\" data-sub-end=\"44\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[67]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.0451em;vertical-align:-4.2526em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.7926em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.7526em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.7526em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.0051em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.2526em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.7526em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.0626em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">null-space dim for Ω</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.8626em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ω joint eigenvector of all </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">_1, </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">_2 coefficients</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3526em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">q_1, q_2, q_3 for Ω</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8625em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;x|Ω&gt; </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> 0 for all x (needed to normalise)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.6574em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ψ(x_0)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.4574em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">normalised &lt;0| = e_24</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.7426em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;x|Ω&gt; = Ψ(x)/Ψ(x_0) for all x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.2526em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.0051em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.2526em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.7526em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.0626em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.8626em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3526em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">57</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"t