pan><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">39083</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31865</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">682803</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">93326</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8625em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.6574em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3249</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">470</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.4574em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.7426em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.2526em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.0051em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.2526em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.7526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.7526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.7526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.7526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.7526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.1051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.7526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.3051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.7526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.5051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.7526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.2526em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[67]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{null-space dim for $\\Omega$} & 1\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\Omega$ joint eigenvector of all $\\tau$\\_1, $\\tau$\\_2 coefficients} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{q\\_1, q\\_2, q\\_3 for $\\Omega$} & \\left\\{1,u^2-\\frac{410\\,u}{57}+\\frac{3145}{171},u^3-\\frac{692\\,u^2}{3553}-\\frac{31865\\,u}{39083}-\\frac{93326}{682803}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{<x|$\\Omega$> $\\not=$ 0 for all x (needed to normalise)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\Psi$(x\\_0)} & \\frac{470}{3249}\\\\\\hline\\text{normalised <0| = e\\_24} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{<x|$\\Omega$> = $\\Psi$(x)/$\\Psi$(x\\_0) for all x} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "9ca97580-d252-4302-b5c6-c1a8c0c5e2a1"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Test on all eigenstates\n\nThe covectors are normalised using $\\Omega$ only. For every one of the 24 eigenstates of the companion $\\tau_a$, the next cell solves that state's own twisted Baxter equation and compares $\\langle x|\\Psi\\rangle/\\langle 0|\\Psi\\rangle$ with $\\Psi(x)/\\Psi(x_0)$ over all 24 $x$.\n\n**Result (80 digits):** the maximum relative deviation is at the working-precision floor (~$10^{-73}$) for all 24 states. The Q-degrees $(\\deg q_1,\\deg q_2,\\deg q_3)$ run over 12 distinct triples.\n\n**Control (scratch evaluation, not kept as a cell):** dropping the twist factor $z_i^{x/h}$ from $\\hat q_i$ gives a relative deviation of $O(1)$. So the check discriminates, and $\\hat q_i$ must include the exponential.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. Independent test: for every eigenstate Ψ of the companion τ's, <x|Ψ>/<0|Ψ> = Ψ(x)/Ψ(x_0)\n   with the covectors normalised on Ω alone. Numeric states at 80 digits, own Baxter Q's per state. ---- *)\nClearAll[wpS, statesS, recS];\nwpS = 80;\nstatesS = Eigenvectors[N[genX[τCoX], wpS]];\nrecS = Table[\n   Module[{v = statesS[[n]], qs, eigRes, bRes, rAct, rForm},\n    qs = qOf[v];\n    eigRes = Max[Table[Max[Abs[τCoX[a, k] . v - Coefficient[tauEig[v, a], u, k] v]], {a, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}]]/Max[Abs[v]];\n    rAct = (xNorm[#] . v)/v[[dtot]]& /@ patPairs;\n    rForm = PsiSoV[qs][#]/PsiSoV[qs][x0]& /@ patPairs;\n    {n, Exponent[qs, u], eigRes, Abs[v[[dtot]]]/Max[Abs[v]], Max[Abs[rAct - rForm]/(Abs[rAct] + Abs[rForm] + 10^-60)]}],\n   {n, Length[statesS]}];\nGrid[Prepend[Map[If[NumericQ[#] && !IntegerQ[#], ScientificForm[N[#, 3]], #]&, recS, {2}],\n   {\"state\", \"deg q_1,q_2,q_3\", \"τ eig. residual\", \"|<0|Ψ>|/max\", \"max rel. dev. over 24 x\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
