span style=\"top:-27.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:17.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-28.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:17.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-30.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:17.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-31.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:17.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-32.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:17.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:14.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
