  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. Scalar product as a determinant of Q's\n\nThe layout is ported from `SU3_L2_Baxter_Twisted_Final.wb` (adjoint²). The rules for mixed or general reps come from `SU3_L1_GeneralRep_Normalization.wb` and `SU3_100x100_L2_ZeroTwist.wb`.\n\n- **Q's.** Direct $Q_i = z_i^{u/h}q_i$ from $\\mathcal O$; dual $Q^j = z_j^{-u/h}q^j$ from the dual Baxter operator with $y=1/z_j$ (gauge $\\nu_3$). Both use minimal degree. The twist $z=(2,3,1/6)$ is unimodular.\n- **Measure.** One contour around the ladder at each site, poles $\\theta_s+h\\{\\lambda^{(s)}_3,\\dots,\\lambda^{(s)}_1\\}$: $\\theta_1+\\{0,1,2\\}$ and $\\theta_2+\\{0,1\\}$, 5 simple poles.\n  $\\langle f\\rangle_\\alpha=\\sum_p f(p)\\,e^{2\\pi i(\\alpha-1)p/h}/\\prod_{p'\\neq p}(p-p')$.\n- **Rows and columns.** Rows $(\\alpha,i,j)$ with $\\alpha\\in\\{1,2\\}$ and $(i,j)\\in\\{(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)\\}$. Columns $u^\\beta(-Q^j_AQ_{B,i},\\ Q^j_AQ^{[-2]}_{B,i},\\ Q^{j[2]}_AQ_{B,i})$, $\\beta=0,1$.\n- **Normalisation, per site with that site's $\\lambda_2$ (adjoint 1, fundamental 0):**\n  - $\\Psi^{\\rm ref}_B=\\prod_s Q_1(\\theta_s+h\\lambda_2)[Q_1(\\theta_s)Q_2(\\theta_s-h)-Q_2(\\theta_s)Q_1(\\theta_s-h)]$, which equals $\\Psi_B(x_0)$, i.e. $\\langle 0|=e_{24}$.\n  - $c^{\\rm ref}_A=\\prod_s Q^3(\\theta_s)[Q^3(\\theta_s)Q^2(\\theta_s+h(\\lambda_2+1))-Q^2(\\theta_s)Q^3(\\theta_s+h(\\lambda_2+1))]$.\n  - $\\mathcal S_Q(A,B)=C_{\\rm vac}\\det N^{AB}/(c^{\\rm ref}_A\\Psi^{\\rm ref}_B)$, with $\\mathcal S_Q(\\Omega,\\Omega)=1$.\n- **Physical side.** Right eigenvectors $R_B$ (companion $\\tau$'s), left $L_A=(R^{-1})_A$. The target is $\\mathcal S_{\\rm vec}(A,B)=\\langle L_A|R_B\\rangle/(\\langle L_A|0'\\rangle\\langle 0|R_B\\rangle)$ with $\\langle 0|=e_{24}$. The ket $|0'\\rangle$ is not fixed yet. Matching the diagonal forces $\\langle L_A|0'\\rangle = 1/(\\mathcal S_Q(A,A)\\langle0|R_A\\rangle)$ for every $A$, so $|0'\\rangle = R\\cdot g$ is determined (up to scale). The cell computes this implied ket and shows its structure.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 8. FSoV determinant: dual Q's, 24x24 det N^{AB} (orthogonality), S_Q, the ket |0'> it implies, and S_Q vs S_vec. ---- *)\nClearAll[ν3X, baxSolveDual, stS, Rmat, Lmat, vacS, lam2, polesSP, wSP, zLog, QDv, QUv, tripleSP, rowKeysSP, rowSP,\n  detNSP, crossSP, psiRefSP, cRefSP, SQ, gSP, ketImplied, Svec, SvecN, sci];\nν3X[y_] := ν[3][y] /. prmX;\n(* dual Baxter operator in gauge ν3, y = 1/z_j; same minimal-degree kernel logic as baxSolve *)\nbaxSolveDual[t1_, t2_, y_] := Module[{c, uu, qq, sh, eq, A, vec = $Failed, d = 0, sv, V},\n  While[vec === $Failed && d <= 8,\n   qq = Sum[c[j] uu^j, {j, 0, d}];\n   sh[s_] := qq /. uu -> u + s;\n   eq = Expand[ν3X[u + hX] ν3X[u + 2 hX] ν3X[u + 3 hX] sh[0] - y (t1 /. u -> u + hX) ν3X[u + 2 hX] ν3X[u + 3 hX] sh[hX]\n      + y^2 (t2 /. u -> u + 2 hX) ν3X[u + 3 hX] sh[2 hX] - y^3 τ3X[u + 3 hX] sh[3 hX]];\n   A = Table[D[row, c[j]], {row, CoefficientList[eq, u]}, {j, 0, d}];\n   Which[\n    A === {} || Max[Abs[Flatten[A]]] == 0, vec = UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1],\n    Precision[A] === Infinity, With[{ns = NullSpace[A]}, If[ns =!= {}, vec = First[ns]]],\n    True,\n    {sv, V} = {SingularValueList[A, Tolerance -> 0], Last[SingularValueDecomposition[A]]};\n    If[Length[sv] == d + 1 && Last[sv]/First[sv] < 10^-30, vec = V[[All, -1]]]];\n   If[vec === $Failed, d++]];\n  If[vec === $Failed, $Failed, Expand[(vec/Last[vec]) . u^Range[0, d]]]];\n\n(* states: right eigenvectors of the companion τ's (80 digits), with direct and dual Q's *)\nstS = Table[With[{t1 = tauEig[v, 1], t2 = tauEig[v, 2]},\n    <|\"vec\" -> v, \"T1\" -> t1, \"T2\" -> t2, \"q\" -> Table[baxSolve[t1, t2, zX[[i]]], {i, 3}],\n      \"qd\" -> Table[baxSolveDual[t1, t2, 1/zX[[j]]], {j, 3}]|>], {v, statesS}];\nRmat = Transpose[stS[[All, \"vec\"]]];\nLmat = Inverse[Rmat];\nvacS = First @ Ordering[Table[Max[Abs[CoefficientList[s[\"T1\"] - (Sum[zX[[i]] ν[i][u], {i, 3}] /. prmX), u]]], {s, stS}], 1];\n\n(* measure: ladder θ_s + h{λ3..λ1} per site *)\nlam2 = {λ1[[2]], λ2[[2]]};\npolesSP = Join[(θ1 /. prmX) + hX Range[λ1[[3]], λ1[[1]]], (θ2 /. prmX) + hX Range[λ2[[3]], λ2[[1]]]];\nwSP = Table[1/Times @@ (polesSP[[r]] - Delete[polesSP, r]), {r, Length[polesSP]}];\nzLog = Log[N[zX, wpS]];\nQDv[B_, i_, x_] := QDv[B, i, x] = Exp[N[x, wpS] zLog[[i]]] (stS[[B, \"q\", i]] /. u -> x);\nQUv[A_, j_, x_] := QUv[A, j, x] = Exp[-N[x, wpS] zLog[[j]]] (stS[[A, \"qd\", j]] /. u -> x);\ntripleSP = {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}};\nrowKeysSP = Flatten[Table[{α, ij}, {α, 2}, {ij, tripleSP}], 1];\nrowSP[A_, B_, {α_, {i_, j_}}] := Sum[With[{x = polesSP[[r]]},\n    wSP[[r]] Exp[2 Pi I (α - 1) N[x, wpS]/hX] Flatten @ Table[x^β {-QUv[A, j, x] QDv[B, i, x], QUv[A, j, x] QDv[B, i, x - hX], QUv[A, j, x + hX] QDv[B, i, x]}, {β, 0, 1}]],\n   {r, Length[polesSP]}];\ndetNSP = Table[Det[rowSP[A, B, #]& /@ rowKeysSP], {A, dtot}, {B, dtot}];\ncrossSP = Max[Abs[detNSP - DiagonalMatrix[Diagonal[detNSP]]]]/Min[Abs[Diagonal[detNSP]]];\n\npsiRefSP = Table[Product[With[{th = {θ1, θ2}[[s]] /. prmX, l2 = lam2[[s]]},\n     QDv[B, 1, th + hX l2] (QDv[B, 1, th] QDv[B, 2, th - hX] - QDv[B, 2, th] QDv[B, 1, th - hX])], {s, 2}], {B, dtot}];\ncRefSP = Table[Product[With[{th = {θ1, θ2}[[s]] /. prmX, l2 = lam2[[s]]},\n     QUv[A, 3, th] (QUv[A, 3, th] QUv[A, 2, th + hX (l2 + 1)] - QUv[A, 2, th] QUv[A, 3, th + hX (l2 + 1)])], {s, 2}], {A, dtot}];\nSQ = With[{raw = detNSP/Outer[Times, cRefSP, psiRefSP]}, raw/raw[[vacS, vacS]]];\n\n(* implied ket: <L_A|0'> = 1/(S_Q(A,A) <0|R_A>)  =>  |0'> = R.g (gauge invariant) *)\ngSP = Table[1/(SQ[[A, A]] Rmat[[dtot, A]]), {A, dtot}];\nketImplied = With[{k = Rmat . gSP}, k/k[[First @ Ordering[-Abs[k], 1]]]];\n\n(* physical side with <0| = e_24 and |0'> = e_24; S_Q is vacuum-normalised, so compare with S_vec/S_vec(Ω,Ω) *)\nSvec = IdentityMatrix[dtot]/Outer[Times, Lmat[[All, dtot]], Rmat[[dtot]]];\nSvecN = Svec/Svec[[vacS, vacS]];\nsci[x_] := ScientificForm[N[x, 3]];\nGrid[{\n  {\"Q-function count / consistency\", {Length @ Union[Exponent[#, u]& /@ stS[[All, \"q\"]]], \"distinct degree triples; deg q^j = 3 - deg q_j for all states:\", And @@ Table[Exponent[s[\"qd\"], u] == 3 - Exponent[s[\"q\"], u], {s, stS}]}},\n  {\"any Baxter solve failed?\", !FreeQ[stS[[All, {\"q\", \"qd\"}]], $Failed]},\n  {\"max |off-diag det N| / min |diag det N| (24x24)\", sci[crossSP]},\n  {\"min |Ψ^ref|, min |c^ref|\", sci /@ {Min[Abs[psiRefSP]], Min[Abs[cRefSP]]}},\n  {\"implied |0'>: support / max |ket - e_24|\", {Flatten @ Position[Abs[ketImplied], _?(# > 10^-40&)], sci[Max[Abs[ketImplied - UnitVector[dtot, dtot]]]]}},\n  {\"S_vec(Ω,Ω) with e_24 references (= 1/C_vac)\", N[Svec[[vacS, vacS]], 20]},\n  {\"max |S_Q - S_vec/S_vec(Ω,Ω)| over 24x24\", sci[Max[Abs[SQ - SvecN]]]},\n  {\"max relative diagonal residual\", sci[Max[Abs[Diagonal[SQ] - Diagonal[SvecN]]/Abs[Diagonal[SvecN]]]]},\n  {\"range of |S_Q(A,A)|\", sci /@ MinMax[Abs[Diagonal[SQ]]]}\n }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"24223\" data-output-id=\"8\" data-out-n=\"99\" data-sub-idx=\"32\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"15\" data-sub-start=\"58\" data-sub-end=\"68\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[99]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:10.88em;vertical-align:-5.17em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.71em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.67em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.67em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:10.84em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.17em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.67em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.82em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Q-function count / consistency</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.62em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">any Baxter solve failed?</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.42em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max |off-diag det N| / min |diag det N| (24x24)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min |Ψ</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">ref|, min |c</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">ref|</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">implied |0’&gt;: support / max |ket - e_24|</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S_vec(Ω,Ω) with e_24 references (= 1/C_vac)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max |S_Q - S_vec/S_vec(Ω,Ω)| over 24x24</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max relative diagonal residual</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">range of |S_Q(A,A)|</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.17em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:10.84em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.17em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.67em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.82em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">distinct degree triples; deg q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">j = 3 - deg q_j for all states:</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.62em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.42em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">9.32</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-72</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">5.41</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span clas