n class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1.02</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.17em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:10.84em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.17em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.67em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.67em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.67em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.67em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.31em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.67em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.52em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.67em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.73em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.67em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.93em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.67em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.67em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.34em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.67em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.17em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[99]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{Q-function count / consistency} & \\left\\{12,\\text{distinct degree triples; deg q\\^{}j = 3 - deg q\\_j for all states:},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{any Baxter solve failed?} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\text{max |off-diag det N| / min |diag det N| (24x24)} & \\text{9.32}\\times 10^{\\text{-72}}\\\\\\hline\\text{min |$\\Psi$\\^{}ref|, min |c\\^{}ref|} & \\left\\{\\text{5.41}\\times 10^{\\text{-2}},\\text{1.90}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{implied |0'>: support / max |ket - e\\_24|} & \\left\\{\\left\\{24\\right\\},\\text{0.}\\times 10^{\\text{-68}}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{S\\_vec($\\Omega$,$\\Omega$) with e\\_24 references (= 1/C\\_vac)} & 2514.1111111111111111\\\\\\hline\\text{max |S\\_Q - S\\_vec/S\\_vec($\\Omega$,$\\Omega$)| over 24x24} & \\text{2.40}\\times 10^{\\text{-78}}\\\\\\hline\\text{max relative diagonal residual} & \\text{0.}\\times 10^{\\text{-71}}\\\\\\hline\\text{range of |S\\_Q(A,A)|} & \\left\\{\\text{9.39}\\times 10^{\\text{-5}},\\text{1.02}\\times 10^{\\text{2}}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "9f6d9234-f1e6-4fc3-b864-e2c12e3da986"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Result (80 digits, θ = (1/3, −8/57), h = 1, z = (2, 3, 1/6))\n\n- **Orthogonality.** The determinant is orthogonal across all 24×24 pairs: max |off-diagonal det N| / min |diagonal det N| = 9×10⁻⁷². This uses the ladder measure $\\theta_1+\\{0,1,2\\}$, $\\theta_2+\\{0,1\\}$. The dual degrees are $\\deg q^j = 3-\\deg q_j$ (12 distinct direct triples).\n- **Implied reference ket.** It is exactly $|0'\\rangle = e_{24}$: every other component is zero at working precision. So the same lowest-weight vector serves on both sides.\n- **Full match.** $\\mathcal S_Q(A,B) = C_{\\rm vac}\\det N^{AB}/(c^{\\rm ref}_A\\Psi^{\\rm ref}_B)$ equals $\\langle L_A|R_B\\rangle/(\\langle L_A|e_{24}\\rangle\\langle e_{24}|R_B\\rangle)$ up to the vacuum constant, with max residual 2×10⁻⁷⁸ over all 24×24 entries. Here $1/C_{\\rm vac} = \\mathcal S_{\\rm vec}(\\Omega,\\Omega) = 2514.111\\ldots = 22627/9$.\n- **Normalisation factors** are the general-rep ones with the site's own $\\lambda_2$: adjoint $\\lambda_2=1$, fundamental $\\lambda_2=0$. No extra state-dependent factor was needed.\n- **Contrast with `SU3_100x100_L2_ZeroTwist.wb`.** There the diagonal twist with exponential branch references left an O(ε) spread for the fundamental. Here the companion-twist references $e_{24}$ reproduce the physical norm exactly at finite twist. Only one row triple $\\{(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)\\}$ has been tested.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. Determinant with abstract state A against a rotated vacuum\n\n- **State A (direct Q's): abstract.** Each value $Q_{A,i}(x)$ is a formal symbol `Qa[i,x]`, twist exponentials included. The expansion never uses a specific A.\n- **State B (dual, \"Hodge\" Q's): the vacuum at a different twist.** $Q^j_B = w_j^{-u/h}q^j_{\\Omega_w}$, from the companion $\\tau$'s at unimodular twist $w=(5/2,7/3,6/35)$.\n- **Determinant.** Same measure, rows and columns as section 6. It is multilinear in rows, so it is expanded exactly as an exterior product row by row. The result is a polynomial of bidegree $(4,2)$ in the $Q_{A,1}$ and $Q_{A,2}$ values.\n- **SoV expansion.** Fit $\\det N = \\sum_x c_x\\,\\Psi_A(x)$ over the 24 SoV labels, with $\\Psi_A$ formal in `Qa`. Normalising by $\\Psi_A(x_0)$ gives $\\det N/\\Psi_A(x_0) = \\sum_x c_x\\,\\langle x|\\Psi_A\\rangle$, so the stripped state is $\\langle V| = \\sum_x c_x\\langle x|$ (the `xNorm` covectors).\n- **Rotation test.** $\\langle V|$ is a $GL(3)$ rotation of $\\langle 0|=e_{24}$, up to scale, iff its line stabiliser $\\{X\\in\\mathfrak{gl}_3:\\langle V|\\rho(X)\\in\\mathbb C\\langle V|\\}$ has dimension 6. The reason: the only $B$-eigenlines with a 6-dimensional (Borel) stabiliser are the lowest-weight line of the regular component 15, which is $e_{24}$ itself, and its translates. The $\\bar 6$ and $3$ lowest-weight lines have 7-dimensional (parabolic) stabilisers.\n- **Further checks.** $\\langle V|$ factorises as adjoint ⊗ fundamental, and $\\langle V|\\propto\\langle\\Omega^L_w|$ (the left vacuum at twist $w$).\n- **Control.** Everything is repeated with $w=z$. Then $\\det N$ is the physical overlap with the actual left vacuum, so $\\langle V|$ must be $\\propto$ `Lmat[[vacS]]`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 9. Abstract-A determinant vs the twist-w vacuum: det N/Ψ_A(x0) = Σ_x c_x <x|Ψ_A>, <V| = Σ_x c_x <x|, rotation test. ---- *)\nClearAll[Qa, prmOf, vacAtTwist, rowFormal, wedgeRow, detFormal, psiFormal, stabDim, numRank, overlapData, overlapTab, wList, Rhat, Xmat];\n\nprmOf[w_] := {θ1 -> 1/3, θ2 -> -8/57, h -> 1, χ1 -> Total[w], χ2 -> w[[1]] w[[2]] + w[[1]] w[[3]] + w[[2]] w[[3]], χ3 -> Times @@ w};\n(* exact companion vacuum at twist w: left eigenvector and dual Q's (baxSolveDual assumes χ3 = 1) *)\nvacAtTwist[w_] := vacAtTwist[w] = Module[{pw = prmOf[w], vac1, ns, om, i0, t1, t2, nsL},\n   vac1 = Expand[Sum[w[[i]] ν[i][u], {i, 3}] /. pw];\n   ns = NullSpace[Join @@ Table[(τCo[1, k] /. pw) - Coefficient[vac1, u, k] IdentityMatrix[dtot], {k, 0, 2}]];\n   om = First[ns]; i0 = First @ Ordering[-Abs[om], 1];\n   {t1, t2} = Table[Sum[(((τCo[a, k] /. pw) . om)[[i0]]/om[[i0]]) u^k, {k, 0, 2 a}], {a, 2}];\n   nsL = NullSpace[Join @@ Flatten[Table[{Transpose[τCo[a, k] /. pw] - Coefficient[{t1, t2}[[a]], u, k] IdentityMatrix[dtot]}, {a, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}], 2]];\n   <|\"w\" -> w, \"nsDims\" -> {Length[ns], Length[nsL]}, \"OmegaL\" -> First[nsL], \"qd\" -> Table[baxSolveDual[t1, t2, 1/w[[j]]], {j, 3}]|>];\n\n(* formal row (α,i,j): Association Qa[i,x] -> 6-vector of coefficients *)\nrowFormal[qd_, w_, {α_, {i_, j_}}] := Module[{acc = <||>, add, lw = Log[N[w, wpS]]},\n   add[var_, vec_] := (acc[var] = Lookup[acc, Key[var], ConstantArray[0, 6]] + vec);\n   Do[With[{p = polesSP[[r]]},\n     With[{wt = wSP[[r]] Exp[2 Pi I (α - 1) N[p, wpS]/hX],\n       qu0 = Exp[-N[p, wpS] lw[[j]]] (qd[[j]] /. u -> p), qu1 = Exp[-N[p + hX, wpS] lw[[j]]] (qd[[j]] /. u -> p + hX)},\n      add[Qa[i, p], wt Flatten @ Table[p^β {-qu0, 0, qu1}, {β, 0, 1}]];\n      add[Qa[i, p - hX], wt Flatten @ Table[p^β {0, qu0, 0}, {β, 0, 1}]]]],\n    {r, Length[polesSP]}];\n   acc];\n(* exterior accumulation: keys {sorted monomial, sorted column subset}; Laplace sign along the newest row *)\nwedgeRow[ω_, row_] := Module[{res = <||>},\n   KeyValueMap[Function[{key, val},\n     KeyValueMap[Function[{var, vec},\n       Do[If[!MemberQ[key[[2]], c] && vec[[c]] =!= 0,\n         With[{ns = Sort[Append[key[[2]], c]], nm = Sort[Append[key[[1]], var]]},\n          res[{nm, ns}] = Lookup[res, Key[{nm, ns}], 0] + (-1)^(Length[ns] + First @ FirstPosition[ns, c]) val vec[[c]]]], {c, 6}]], row]], ω];\n   res];\ndetFormal[qd_, w_] := Total[KeyValueMap[#2 (Times @@ #1[[1]])&, Fold[wedgeRow, <|{{}, {}} -> 1|>, rowFormal[qd, w, #]& /@ rowKeysSP]]];\npsiFormal[p_] := Product[With[{xr = xRoots[s, p[[s]]] /. prmX},\n    Qa[1, xr[[1]]] (Qa[1, xr[[2]]] Qa[2, xr[[3]]] - Qa[2, xr[[2]]] Qa[1, xr[[3]]])], {s, 2}];\n\nnumRank[m_, tol_] := Length[SingularValueList[N[m, wpS], Tolerance -> tol]];\n(* dim of {X in gl3 : <v|ρ(X) ∈ C<v|} *)\nstabDim[v_] := 10 - numRank[Transpose[Append[Flatten[Table[v . Normal[Etot[i, j]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 1], -v]], 10^-50];\n\n(* twist-z eigenstates normalised by <0|R_A> = 1, and X[x,A] = <x|R_A> = Ψ_A(x)/Ψ_A(x0) *)\nRhat = Rmat . DiagonalMatrix[1/Rmat[[dtot]]];\nXmat = Table[xNorm[p] . Rhat[[All, A]], {p, patPairs}, {A, dtot}];\n\noverlapData[w_] := Module[{vac = vacAtTwist[w], dF, vars, crD, crP, monos, M, b, cxF, fitRes, psiWeight, D, cx, V, sovRes, Vn},\n   dF = Expand[detFormal[vac[\"qd\"], w]];\n   (* (i) formal fit det = Σ_x c_x Ψ(x) over the 24 SoV labels -- diagnostic *)\n   vars = Union[Cases[dF, _Qa, ∞], Cases[psiFormal /@ patPairs, _Qa, ∞]];\n   crD = Association[CoefficientRules[dF, vars]];\n   crP = Association[CoefficientRules[Expand[psiFormal[#]], vars]]& /@ patPairs;\n   monos = Union[Keys[crD], Join @@ (Keys /@ crP)];\n   M = Table[Lookup[crP[[x]], Key[m], 0], {m, monos}, {x, Length[patPairs]}];\n   b = Lookup[crD, Key[#], 0]& /@ monos;\n   cxF = LeastSquares[N[M, wpS], b];\n   fitRes = Max[Abs[M . cxF - b]]/Max[Abs[b]];\n   psiWeight = Total[Abs[KeySelect[crD, MemberQ[Union @@ (Keys /@ crP), #]&]]]/Total[Abs[crD]];\n   (* (ii) on-shell: D_A = det N(A, Ω_w)/Ψ_A(x0) with Qa -> Q_A (twist z); solve Σ_x c_x <x|R_A> = D_A *)\n   D = Table[(dF /. Qa[i_, x_] :> QDv[A, i, x])/(psiFormal[x0] /. Qa[i_, x_] :> QDv[A, i, x]), {A, dtot}];\n   cx = D . Inverse[Xmat];\n   V = cx . Table[xNorm[p], {p, patPairs}];\n   sovRes = Max[Abs[V . Rhat - D]]/Max[Abs[D]];\n   Vn = V/V[[First @ Ordering[-Abs[V], 1]]];\n   <|\"w\" -> w, \"nsDims\" -> vac[\"nsDims\"], \"nMonos\" -> {Length[crD], Length[monos]}, \"fitRes\" -> fitRes, \"psiWeight\" -> psiWeight,\n     \"D\" -> D, \"cx\" -> cx, \"V\" -> Vn, \"sovRes\" -> sovRes, \"prodSV\" -> SingularValueList[Partition[Vn, d2], Tolerance -> 0],\n     \"stab\" -> stabDim[Vn], \"rankOmegaL\" -> numRank[{Vn, vac[\"OmegaL\"]}, 10^-50], \"rankLvac\" -> numRank[{Vn, Lmat[[vacS]]}, 10^-50],\n     \"rankE24\" -> numRank[{Vn, UnitVector[dtot, dtot]}, 10^-50]|>];\n\nwList = {{5/2, 7/3, 6/35}, zX};\noverlapTab = overlapData /@ wList;\nsci[x_] := ScientificForm[N[x, 3]];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{d[\"w\"], d[\"nsDims\"], d[\"nMonos\"], sci[d[\"fitRes\"]], sci[d[\"psiWeight\"]], sci[d[\"sovRes\"]],\n     sci[d[\"prodSV\"][[2]]/d[\"prodSV\"][[1]]], d[\"stab\"], d[\"rankOmegaL\"], d[\"rankLvac\"], d[\"rankE24\"]}, {d, overlapTab}],\n   {\"twist w\", \"vacuum null dims (R,L)\", \"#monomials (det, det∪Ψ)\", \"formal fit over 24 Ψ(x): rel. residual\", \"weight of det in Ψ-type monomials\",\n    \"on-shell <V|R_A> = D_A residual\", \"σ₂/σ₁ of V as 8×3\", \"line-stabiliser dim of <V| (6 ⇔ rotation of e_24)\", \"rank{V, Ω^L_w}\", \"rank{V, L_vac(z)}\", \"rank{V, e_24}\"}],\n  Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"24223\" data-output-id=\"9\" data-out-n=\"115\" data-sub-idx=\"21\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"18\" data-sub-start=\"69\" data-sub-end=\"73\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[115]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.66em;vertical-align:-1.56em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.1em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.06em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.62em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.56em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.06em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.22em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">twist w</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">35</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height