  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 22. Survey of the minors that contain Q_2 rows (Wronskian minors), sizes 2-5, against the twist-w vacuum.\n   Two stages. The filter runs at machine precision: an identically vanishing minor is pure cancellation, so at\n   80 digits its determinant has precision 0 and every later comparison then triggers $MaxExtraPrecision retries --\n   that alone made the survey 50x slower. The filter is deliberately LOOSE (mismatch < 10^-3, and the machine\n   determinants are badly conditioned) and every minor that survives it is re-tested at 80 digits. ---- *)\nClearAll[rowsAll, psi0, Pinv, rowsM, psi0M, PinvM, detVecM, scaleM, mismatch, detVec80, c80, i1Keys, i2Keys, shapes, surveyShape, surveyOut, confirm80, surveyTime];\nrowsAll[zz_] := rowsAll[zz] = With[{ch = chainM[zz], qd = vacAtTwist[wM][\"qd\"]},\n   Table[Table[rowN[st[\"q\"], zz, qd, wM, key], {key, rowKeys12}], {st, ch[\"states\"]}]];\npsi0[zz_] := psi0[zz] = With[{ch = chainM[zz]}, Table[psiG[st[\"q\"], zz][x0], {st, ch[\"states\"]}]];\nPinv[zz_] := Pinv[zz] = Inverse[chainM[zz][\"P\"]];\nrowsM[zz_] := rowsM[zz] = N[rowsAll[zz]];\npsi0M[zz_] := psi0M[zz] = N[psi0[zz]];\nPinvM[zz_] := PinvM[zz] = N[Pinv[zz]];\ndetVecM[rs_, cols_, zz_] := Table[Det[rowsM[zz][[A, rs, cols]]]/psi0M[zz][[A]], {A, dtot}];\nscaleM[rs_, cols_, zz_, n_] := Max[Abs[Flatten[rowsM[zz][[All, rs, cols]]]]]^n/Min[Abs[psi0M[zz]]];\n(* relative mismatch of the two c-vectors after normalising on their largest component: 0 = twist-independent *)\nmismatch[c1_, c2_] := Module[{p = First @ Ordering[-Abs[c1], 1]}, Max[Abs[c1/c1[[p]] - c2/c2[[p]]]]];\ndetVec80[rs_, cols_, zz_] := Table[Det[rowsAll[zz][[A, rs, cols]]]/psi0[zz][[A]], {A, dtot}];\nc80[rs_, cols_, zz_] := Pinv[zz] . detVec80[rs, cols, zz];\n\ni1Keys = Flatten @ Position[rowKeys12, {_, 1, _}];\ni2Keys = Flatten @ Position[rowKeys12, {_, 2, _}];\n(* shapes: {number of i=1 rows, number of i=2 rows}; {4,2} is the full 6x6 scalar product of section 6 *)\nshapes = {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {3, 1}, {2, 2}, {3, 2}};\nsurveyShape[{n1_, n2_}] := Module[{rowsets, colsets, n = n1 + n2, nMinors = 0, nNonzero = 0, best = Infinity, loose, dv, cz, czp, ms},\n   rowsets = Flatten[Outer[Join, Subsets[i1Keys, {n1}], Subsets[i2Keys, {n2}], 1], 1];\n   colsets = Subsets[Range[6], {n}];\n   loose = Last @ Reap[\n      Do[nMinors++;\n       dv = detVecM[rs, cs, zX];\n       If[Max[Abs[dv]] > 10^-10 scaleM[rs, cs, zX, n],\n        nNonzero++;\n        cz = PinvM[zX] . dv;\n        czp = PinvM[zP] . detVecM[rs, cs, zP];\n        ms = mismatch[cz, czp];\n        If[ms < best, best = ms];\n        If[ms < 10^-3, Sow[{rs, cs, ms}]]],\n       {rs, rowsets}, {cs, colsets}], _, (#2 &)];\n   loose = If[loose === {} || loose === Null, {}, First[loose]];\n   <|\"shape\" -> {n1, n2}, \"nMinors\" -> nMinors, \"nNonzero\" -> nNonzero, \"best\" -> best, \"loose\" -> loose|>];\n{surveyTime, surveyOut} = AbsoluteTiming[Quiet[surveyShape /@ shapes, Det::luc]];\n(* 80-digit confirmation of every minor that survived the loose filter *)\nconfirm80 = Flatten[Table[Table[{s[\"shape\"], l[[1]], l[[2]], l[[3]], mismatch[c80[l[[1]], l[[2]], zX], c80[l[[1]], l[[2]], zP]]},\n     {l, s[\"loose\"]}], {s, surveyOut}], 1];\nColumn[{\n  Grid[Prepend[Table[{s[\"shape\"], s[\"nMinors\"], s[\"nNonzero\"], sci[s[\"best\"]], Length[s[\"loose\"]]}, {s, surveyOut}],\n    {\"shape {#i=1, #i=2 rows}\", \"minors\", \"not identically zero\", \"best twist mismatch (machine filter)\", \"survived mismatch < 10^-3\"}],\n   Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[If[confirm80 === {}, {{\"no minor survived the loose filter -- none of these shapes is an SoV expansion\"}},\n    Prepend[Table[{r[[1]], r[[2]], r[[3]], sci[r[[4]]], sci[r[[5]]]}, {r, confirm80}],\n     {\"shape\", \"rows\", \"columns\", \"machine mismatch\", \"80-digit mismatch\"}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[{{\"survey time (s)\", surveyTime}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"24223\" data-output-id=\"21\" data-out-n=\"283\" data-sub-idx=\"22\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"52\" data-sub-start=\"44\" data-sub-end=\"51\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[283]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.74em;vertical-align:-4.62em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.12em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.12em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.89em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shape {#i=1, #i=2 rows}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">minors</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">540</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1800</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1800</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3375</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1800</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">not identically zero</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">532</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">880</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">best twist mismatch (machine filter)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">2.03894</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">4.02117</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">7.93536</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" st