      {
       "data": "Out[314]= \\begin{matrix}\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{base: rotation fit residual / (a,b,c) - (-w1w2, w1, -w1(w2+w3))} & \\left\\{\\text{0.}\\times 10^{\\text{-70}},\\left\\{0,0,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{base: twist-independence residual, scale kappa} & \\left\\{\\text{0.}\\times 10^{\\text{-69}},1.323110353+0.\\times 10^{-10}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{base surface value b - a(c-a)} & \\text{0.}\\times 10^{\\text{-69}}\\\\\\hline\\text{dim W (expect 4) / \\#rotation conditions} & \\left\\{4,20\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{conditions x directions} & \\left\\{44,30\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{dim of the allowed deformation space} & 14\\\\\\hline\\text{do the 7 known-harmless directions satisfy all conditions?} & \\mathrm{Indeterminate}\\\\\\hline\\text{rank of \\{allowed space, 7 known directions\\} (7 = nothing new)} & 14\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{allowed direction \\#} & \\text{first-order (da, db, dc), normalised} & \\text{|d[b-a(c-a)]| relative}\\\\\\hline1 & \\left\\{1.50968\\times 10^{-10}-2.62889\\times 10^{-10}\\,\\mathrm{i},0.997303+0.073395\\,\\mathrm{i},-0.170966-0.012582\\,\\mathrm{i}\\right\\} & \\text{0.}\\times 10^{\\text{-65}}\\\\\\hline2 & \\left\\{3.58153\\times 10^{-9}+4.3197\\times 10^{-10}\\,\\mathrm{i},-0.9928… [latex truncated: 3206 chars total]",
